Formatter: decide multiline string hugging on the text the output keeps (a newline after `**`
or the parentheses of a parenthesized string flipped the decision on the next run).
Regression test included; fuzz repro: repro/fix-formatter-string-hugging.py (ruff_formatter_idempotency).

